{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45169","headline":"白苹洲送洛阳李丞使还 · 皎然","name":"白苹洲送洛阳李丞使还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苹洲北望楚山重，千里回轺止一封。\n临水情来还共载，看花醉去更相从。\n罢宫风渚何时别，寄隐云阳几处逢。\n後会那应似畴昔，年年觉老雪山容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}